      "widgets_values": [
        "此處只寫與臉部描述相關的提示詞，和整體照片品質的提示詞。\n可使用人物lora。\n某些圖片可能會無法辨識臉部，導致\"FaceDetailer\"的功能失效。\n\nThis section only includes prompts related to facial descriptions and overall photo quality.\nThe character Lora can be used.\nSome images may fail to recognize faces, causing the \"FaceDetailer\" function to malfunction."
